Package: maxwellfit
Title: Robust Generalized Maxwell Fitting of Stress-Relaxation Curves
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Raphael S.", "Knecht", email = "210419157+Knechtrs@users.noreply.github.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4434-8442"))
Description: Multi-start, bounded non-linear least-squares fitting of
    n-element generalized Maxwell models to normalized stress-relaxation data,
    with model comparison and diagnostics that flag unreliable fits.
